FUTODT.DC 76.11.30 FUTIL ODT Class Commands

/ 0 Current Output mode
#   BCD
$   OS/8 ASCII
:   signed decimal
<   Octal
=   Unsigned Decimal
>   PDP8 Symbolic
@   Date
[   ASCII
]   Packed ASCII
ESC use last FORMAT Command
CR  Close location
;   s/a LF, but don't type out location & contents
LF  .+1
!   .-1
^   MRI
_   Indirect
n+  .+n
n-  .-n
